    return (...args: any[]) => {
        if (timer !== null) {
            return; // already scheduled
        }
        timer = setTimeout(() => {
            fn(args);
            timer = null;
        }, waitMs);
    };
}
```

Also, the cleanup function (cancel) might be needed, but the signature stays the same. The self-test should test the debounce behavior.

